@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title vive_teleop deployment

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace

node "Operator workstation" as Host {
  artifact "Unity Linux player\nunity-vr-headset/Builds/Linux/vive-teleop" as UnityPlayer
  artifact "Browser debug client\nindex.html" as Browser
  artifact "Startup scripts\nscripts/*.sh" as Scripts
  folder "logs/<timestamp>/" as Logs
}

node "Docker / host-network runtime" as Docker {
  node "ros2_app_wifi\nport 8088" as Ros2App
  node "moveit_server_wifi" as MoveItServer
  node "coturn_wifi\nUDP/TCP 3478" as Coturn
  artifact "/tmp/cyclonedds.xml" as CycloneConfig
}

node "Robot network" as RobotNetwork {
  node "TIAGo robot\n10.68.0.1\nROS_DOMAIN_ID=67" as Robot {
    queue "/head_front_camera/rgb/image_raw" as Camera
    queue "/joint_states" as JointStates
    component "TF tree" as TfTree
    queue "/head_controller/joint_trajectory" as HeadController
    queue "/arm_controller/joint_trajectory" as ArmController
    queue "/gripper_controller/joint_trajectory" as GripperController
  }
}

Scripts --> Docker : docker compose up --build
Scripts --> UnityPlayer : build/run
Scripts --> Logs : startup + validation logs
UnityPlayer --> Logs : unity-player.log
Ros2App --> Logs : ros2_app_wifi.log
MoveItServer --> Logs : moveit_server_wifi.log
Coturn --> Logs : coturn_wifi.log

UnityPlayer --> Ros2App : HTTP/WebRTC\n/config /offer /input_offer\nport 8088
Browser --> Ros2App : HTTP/WebRTC\n/config /robot_state /offer /input_offer
UnityPlayer .. Coturn : ICE TURN candidates
Browser .. Coturn : ICE TURN candidates

Ros2App --> Robot : ROS 2 DDS\ncamera, joint states, TF
MoveItServer --> Robot : ROS 2 DDS\njoint states, TF, controllers
CycloneConfig --> Ros2App : discovery peer + interface
CycloneConfig --> MoveItServer : discovery peer + interface

Camera --> Ros2App : image frames
JointStates --> Ros2App : head/gripper state
TfTree --> Ros2App : wrist/head snapshot TF
JointStates --> MoveItServer : robot state
TfTree --> MoveItServer : wrist anchor/current pose
MoveItServer --> HeadController : head trajectory
MoveItServer --> ArmController : Servo output trajectory
MoveItServer --> GripperController : gripper trajectory

note bottom of Docker
  Wi-Fi mode uses host networking.
  Field mode uses docker-compose.yml ipvlan addresses:
  ros2_app=10.68.0.132, coturn=10.68.0.133, moveit_server=10.68.0.134.
end note

@enduml
